39"},"H2754":{"lemma":"חָרִיט","xlit":"chârîyṭ","pron":"khaw-reet'","derivation":"or חָרִט; from the same as H2747 (חֶרֶט);","strongs_def":"properly, cut out (or hollow), i.e. (by implication) a pocket","kjv_def":"bag, crisping pin.","n":2,"o":"2KI5:23 ISA3:22"},"H2755":{"lemma":"חֲרֵי־יוֹנִים","xlit":"chărêy-yôwnîym","pron":"khar-ay'-yo-neem'","derivation":"from the plural of H2716 (חֶרֶא) and the plural of H3123 (יוֹנָה); or perhaps rather the plural of a single word חֲרָאיוֹן, probably a kind of vegetable","strongs_def":"excrements of doves {or a vegetable}","kjv_def":"doves' dung.","n":0,"o":""},"H2756":{"lemma":"חָרִיף","xlit":"Chârîyph","pron":"khaw-reef'","derivation":"from H2778 (חָרַף); autumnal;","strongs_def":"Chariph, the name of two Israelites","kjv_def":"Hariph.","n":2,"o":"NEH7:24 NEH10:19"},"H2757":{"lemma":"חָרִיץ","xlit":"chârîyts","pron":"khaw-reets'","derivation":"or חֲרִץ; from H2782 (חָרַץ); (compare H2742 (חֲרוּץ))","strongs_def":"properly, incisure or (passively) incised; hence, a threshing-sledge (with sharp teeth); also a slice (as cut)","kjv_def":"[phrase] cheese, harrow.","n":2,"o":"2SA12:31 1CH20:3"},"H2758":{"lemma":"חָרִישׁ","xlit":"chârîysh","pron":"khaw-reesh'","derivation":"from H2790 (חָרַשׁ);","strongs_def":"ploughing or its season","kjv_def":"earing (time), ground.","n":3,"o":"GEN45:6 EXO34:21 1SA8:12"},"H2759":{"lemma":"חֲרִישִׁי","xlit":"chărîyshîy","pron":"khar-ee-shee'","derivation":"from H2790 (חָרַשׁ) in the sense of silence;","strongs_def":"quiet, i.e. sultry (as feminine noun, the sirocco or hot east wind)","kjv_def":"vehement.","n":1,"o":"JON4:8"},"H2760":{"lemma":"חָרַךְ","xlit":"chârak","pron":"khaw-rak'","derivation":"a primitive root;","strongs_def":"to braid (i.e. to entangle or snare) or catch (game) in anet","kjv_def":"roast.","n":1,"o":"PRO12:27"},"H2761":{"lemma":"חֲרַךְ","xlit":"chărak","pron":"khar-ak'","derivation":"(Aramaic) a root probably allied to the equivalent of H2787 (חָרַר);","strongs_def":"to scorch","kjv_def":"singe.","n":1,"o":"DAN3:27"},"H2762":{"lemma":"חֶרֶךְ","xlit":"cherek","pron":"kheh'-rek","derivation":"from H2760 (חָרַךְ);","strongs_def":"properly, a net, i.e. (by analogy) lattice","kjv_def":"lattice.","n":1,"o":"SNG2:9"},"H2763":{"lemma":"חָרַם","xlit":"châram","pron":"khaw-ram'","derivation":"a primitive root;","strongs_def":"to seclude; specifically (by a ban) to devote to religious uses (especially destruction); physical and reflexive, to be blunt as to the nose","kjv_def":"make accursed, consecrate, (utterly) destroy, devote, forfeit, have a flat nose, utterly (slay, make away).","n":48,"o":"EXO22:20 LEV21:18 LEV27:28 LEV27:29 NUM21:2 NUM21:3 DEU2:34 DEU3:6 DEU7:2 DEU13:15 DEU20:17 JOS2:10 JOS6:18 JOS6:21 JOS8:26 JOS10:1 JOS10:28 JOS10:35 JOS10:37 JOS10:39 JOS10:40 JOS11:11 JOS11:12 JOS11:20 JOS11:21 JDG1:17 JDG21:11 1SA15:3 1SA15:8 1SA15:9 1SA15:15 1SA15:18 1SA15:20 1KI9:21 2KI19:11 1CH4:41 2CH20:23 2CH32:14 EZR10:8 ISA11:15 ISA34:2 ISA37:11 JER25:9 JER50:21 JER50:26 JER51:3 DAN11:44 MIC4:13"},"H2764":{"lemma":"חֵרֶם","xlit":"chêrem","pron":"khay'-rem","derivation":"or (Zechariah 14:11) חֶרֶם; from H2763 (חָרַם);","strongs_def":"physical (as shutting in) a net (either literally or figuratively); usually a doomed object; abstractly extermination","kjv_def":"(ac-) curse(-d, -d thing), dedicated thing, things which should have been utterly destroyed, (appointed to) utter destruction, devoted (thing), net.","n":31,"o":"LEV27:21 LEV27:28 LEV27:29 NUM18:14 DEU7:26 DEU13:17 JOS6:17 JOS6:18 JOS7:1 JOS7:11 JOS7:12 JOS7:13 JOS7:15 JOS22:20 1SA15:21 1KI20:42 1CH2:7 ECC7:26 ISA34:5 ISA43:28 EZK26:5 EZK26:14 EZK32:3 EZK44:29 EZK47:10 MIC7:2 HAB1:15 HAB1:16 HAB1:17 ZEC14:11 MAL4:6"},"H2765":{"lemma":"חֳרֵם","xlit":"Chŏrêm","pron":"khor-ame'","derivation":"from H2763 (חָרַם); devoted;","strongs_def":"Chorem, a place in Palestine","kjv_def":"Horem.","n":1,"o":"JOS19:38"},"H2766":{"lemma":"חָרִם","xlit":"Chârim","pron":"khaw-reem'","derivation":"from H2763 (חָ